{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_st_06-01","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"st_06-01","title":"別說過去的事","storyCode":"6-6","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_06-01.txt","sourceHash":"6e2f4c9feda011be86f3cd6da7d0e6a623b250c2efb68572f2507b8b6b0f6c0f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊諾，這本書是談什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我讀過了，就給你帶來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得薩沙你會喜歡！這本書是講理想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"理想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊諾有什麼理想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......理想啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。我可以有理想嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以有，為什麼會沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟了，該回家了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不想走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是伊諾你說過，要是不回家，你爸爸就會打你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天再見吧？明天還是能再見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。麵包和書我就放這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......薩沙，我不想走。好痛。現在回去也會挨打的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼明天來了，你如果被打了，就打我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？......哈哈哈，薩沙，你是不是跟他們打架，把頭腦打傻了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的身上還有傷，這麼多傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要這樣，就會有人能知道你很痛。至少有人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道你的想法。但我不會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果那幾個孩子還在路上欺負你，告訴我！我會把他們全打趴的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天見！我還會來唱歌給你聽的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我根本不知道他遭遇過什麼。\n我只知道他給過我吃的。\n只知道他能讀書，我也想讀，他就教我。\n只知道其他孩子喜歡欺負他，因為他給我麵包，我更有力氣些，就打了他們，也被他們打過。\n但我不知道他遭遇的是什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很怕。薩沙，我很害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我似乎......似乎不屬於那個家。我偷聽說，我媽媽......我媽媽根本不在家裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們看我的眼神，都很可怕，我不想回去了。我不想再回去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這裡既沒有吃的，也沒有可以住的地方，這裡只是......只是下水道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也討厭我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為我喜歡笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。為什麼會這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為我不該笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有這回事！伊諾就應該笑下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是不是那天他不回去，事情就會改變？\n只因為我覺得我這裡太髒了，太冷了，就讓他回去？\n如果他沒有回去，是不是能改變一切？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的傷！你肚子上的傷......發生什麼，發生什麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩沙......我一直在笑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你和我說可以笑的，我就一直笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一直在笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩沙，還要聽我唱歌嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"之後，他依然時常來看我。\n只是他身上的傷疤越來越多......\n越來越多。\n我也知道自己說的話會影響他，也減少了張口的次數。\n這會讓事情變好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的背！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的背......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......很痛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不能再這樣下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"究竟是誰做了這些事！為什麼要這麼虐待你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管是什麼......這種人都該被毀掉！無論是什麼東西，都該被毀掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊諾，帶我去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會做到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不知道自己說了什麼。\n也不知道自己是不是什麼都不能再說了。\n我做了什麼？我究竟做了什麼？\n我也讀了許多書了，但沒有書告訴過我。\n什麼都沒告訴我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看啊，看啊薩沙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和我說過，希望把傷害我的東西全都毀掉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要緊。不要緊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看，只要輕輕一吹......就都好了。全都會好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快過來，我給你包紮！布，剩下的布在哪......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個男人切了我的腳......只要一吹，就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有個老頭劃了我的背，撫摸一下，也就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這都是因為那個胖女人往我嗓子裡塞的那塊源石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，伊諾，別說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法再唱歌了，但你看，你看，都虧了這塊源石！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我現在什麼都能做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊諾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你很不開心。為什麼？我明明按你說的去做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你不開心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明明他們都開心的。只要按他們說的去做，他們就都會開心的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......因為你的所有家人都是混蛋。全部都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以孩子們把他們殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些感染的孩子們，還沒被趕到城外的孩子們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把他們怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們也打過我啊。他們還弄傷過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，他們簡直就像是棋盤上的棋子一樣。棋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要我給他們治過身上的傷，讓他們怎麼做，他們就會怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我把那群又醜又噁心的人，全都......全部都！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩沙，你看，我做的怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一把火全部燒掉了！全部！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩沙，你怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別再做這種事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你不是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到會變成這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊諾，做你真正想做的吧。不是這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會幫你的。別再這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別再這樣了！做你真正想做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是被逼著做什麼，不是流血流淚，也不是什麼復仇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你根本不喜歡這種事......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......薩沙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想......唱歌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我什麼也做不到。\n我真是沒用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊諾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不能再唱歌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起走吧。我們會活下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......有什麼好的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我們可以一起活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我從礦場偷來的源石，本來想要賣掉換些吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩沙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，我們就都是感染者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩沙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們一起活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些事情？我不會過問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你所做的一切都沒有理由。你不是為了什麼理由才活在大地上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你根本不需要誰去拯救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"選一個你喜歡的名字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個？好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特。從今以後，你就是梅菲斯特。你和以前的你再無瓜葛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信你。我沒有權力相信你。能相信你的從來就只有你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的所作所為不能一筆勾銷，你會永遠背負著你做過的一切，哪怕你忘記了，哪怕你不能理解你做了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做的一切，你經歷的一切，都該成為你的薪柴。它們要逼迫著你，要你內心的火繼續燃燒下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到整片大地都解放，直到你拋棄所有別人給你的東西，直到你終於理解你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候，你連這個名字都可以拋棄。是去是留是生是死，你自己選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特，我不能改變你的理想。如果你沒有，就去找它。我們自己拯救自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是誰？這不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想知道怎麼叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......塔露拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個反抗者，一個普通的人。我誰也不是。只是現在，你可以叫我塔露拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而塔露拉沒有和我說太多。\n她抱緊了我。在我的背上叩了三下。\n塔露拉相信我。葉蓮娜，博卓卡斯替，柳德米拉。他們都相信我。\n我本以為我可以把在那座城市度過的童年拋到腦後。\n只是，事情很快就變了。從那個村莊的事情開始。\n那是一樁慘劇。但為什麼這種慘劇會讓她變成這樣？\n為什麼變成這樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你要我做什麼，我就會做什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的。只要你想做，就去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我允許了。畢竟你是梅菲斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你以前說過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那是幾年前的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"隨著我們事業的進步，有些事情會自然而然地改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不跟上形勢，我們就會被淘汰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們和我們的感染者同胞，必須爭取一個未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都可以為了這個理想犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以信任你，對吧，領袖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"對。因為我是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我會做到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定會，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有你，我們做不到。你什麼都可以做，也什麼都可以做到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該全都看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的她......不是你這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉只是個名字。塔露拉只是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"幫助他吧。梅菲斯特需要你的幫助。梅菲斯特需要你去讓他有價值。他只信任你我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉絕不會這樣，你在利用他對你的信任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都沒有選擇的權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你會為他做到的。一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你想不想看著他死？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒意識到嗎？在路過那個村子之後，塔露拉就完全變了！她徹底變了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼還這麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你和塔露拉姐姐，我誰也不會信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，我們去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，告訴我。我們該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"活著難道不痛苦嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們可以一起活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這本書，是談論理想的。\n我的理想是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["塔露拉"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]}]}
